WEBVTT

00:00:02.581 --> 00:00:07.458
Telo Ride 1 is always solo. So group classes and the ride hub are gone.

00:00:10.324 --> 00:00:15.345
A class card carries no group chip, and Class Start no longer asks how you want to

00:00:15.345 --> 00:00:17.911
ride. It has one button: Start class.

00:00:23.228 --> 00:00:28.285
Open an old link to a group session and the class rides solo, with Pause, no board,

00:00:28.285 --> 00:00:30.230
and no connection to a hub.

00:00:36.133 --> 00:00:40.831
The hub client left the app with its library. The backend lost its hub, its

00:00:40.831 --> 00:00:43.637
sessions, its bots and its race results.

00:00:49.038 --> 00:00:53.542
Class Start, with its one button, on every screen from a phone to a desktop.

00:00:59.361 --> 00:01:04.052
What the tests prove: no group is offered, a session link rides solo, and every

00:01:04.052 --> 00:01:05.480
check still passes.

00:01:12.266 --> 00:01:17.920
Telo Ride 1, from the Telo family, is the focused edition of Telo Ride: one class,

00:01:17.920 --> 00:01:19.116
nothing else.

00:01:19.461 --> 00:01:24.413
It pairs with a smart bike at home over Bluetooth, plays the class video, or draws

00:01:24.413 --> 00:01:29.425
the Ibiza Sunset Strip course to music if the rider chooses it, and sets the bike's

00:01:29.425 --> 00:01:32.926
resistance for every interval while the rider pedals.

00:01:33.272 --> 00:01:37.247
Connect the bike, take the class, see your number, and come back to beat it.
